>
> You have extra luck.
> Bad luck does not time out for you.
> Good luck does not time out for you.

Luck timeout is not the same as luck.

A blessed luckstone will keep good luck from timing out, but it will
allow bad luck to timeout so you eventually end up at worst zero.

A cursed luckstone will keep bad luck from timing out, but it will
allow good luck to timeout so you eventually end up with at best zero.

An uncursed luckstone won't let either type of luck timeout, so the
luck you earn is the luck you keep.

All in addition to the +/- 3 effect on the value of luck conferred
by the stone, and that's the first message.

